{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-moon life-theme-icon-dark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-language-switch","aria-label":"English Choose language","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-globe","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h20"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["English"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-account","href":"/en/sign-in"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Sign in to sync"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/05"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Don’t waste money"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Turn off all automatic renewals and switch to manual renewal upon expiry"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Conduct the annual tax reconciliation from March to June; be sure to include all eligible special deductions"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Housing provident fund isn’t just for buying a home: it can be used for renting, home renovations, and paying property taxes, effective from September 20, 2026 under new regulations"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Recalculate your mobile and broadband plans annually: downgrade unused services, and file a complaint if the carrier refuses to comply"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Not buying lottery tickets"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Walk away the moment you see “high returns,” “guaranteed returns,” or “sure profits”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Avoid making minimum payments on credit cards, and never sign up for installment plans or consumer loans for purchases; if borrowing is unavoidable, first convert the interest rate to an annual percentage rate before comparing options"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Don’t give streamers tips, don’t make in‑game purchases, and don’t make impulsive buys"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"When kids make in-app purchases or send gifts, parents can demand refunds for large sums spent by kids over eight if they never gave consent"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Teaching kids one key phrase: anyone who asks them to use a parent’s phone to enter verification codes is a scammer"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Skipping extended warranties for electronics"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Prefer generic drugs that have passed consistency evaluation and those selected in centralized procurement"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Once you set up family medical expense sharing in the yibao app, funds from your individual medical insurance account can be used to pay for your spouse, parents, and children’s medical care and medication"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Drink boiled tap water instead of routinely ordering large water-dispenser bottles or buying small bottled water"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Infrequent stock trading"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Don’t borrow money to invest, avoid leverage, and never buy assets you don’t understand"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Using broad-market index funds instead of actively managed funds as a long-term core holding (the portion of money you keep invested for years)"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"When picking similar funds, go for those with lower fees"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Don’t put all your money into one stock, one platform, or one property"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"Individuals paying income tax at a rate of 10% or higher can open a private pension account; up to 12,000 yuan per year can be deducted from taxable income. For those paying no tax or only a 3% rate, opening such an account is not worthwhile"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Paying for gym visits individually or on short-term plans is only worthwhile if you have a consistent attendance record spanning over a year"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Sign a written contract before paying a deposit; if a business faces risks, it must stop taking payments, and you have the right to get back any unused balance if it shuts down"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Implementing a 24-hour cooling-off period for non-essential big-ticket purchases; making full use of the seven-day no-questions-asked return policy for online shopping"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Don’t fall for “strikethrough prices” or impulse buying during sales"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"It’s better to choose a non‑return insurance plan and treat any “refunds” or dividends as non‑guaranteed benefits"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"Get sufficient third‑party liability coverage: the mandatory insurance limits are uniform nationwide and relatively low, so any excess must be paid out of your own pocket"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-27"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"Set aside an emergency fund equal to 3–6 months of living expenses in a readily accessible account"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"Run a quick comparison before paying off your mortgage — don’t rely on gut feeling"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/05-29","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"When shopping online, follow platform rules and laws — not influencers or “positive reviews”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"If something goes wrong after buying from a livestream, first ask the platform for the seller’s and influencer’s details — they’re required to provide them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"If you buy unsafe food, you can demand ten times the purchase price as compensation; if the amount is under 1,000 yuan, you’re still entitled to 1,000 yuan"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-32"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"Check national inspection reports, 3C certification, and energy labels before buying big-ticket items"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-33"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"Bracelets, jade, luxury watches, and collectibles should be judged by “how much you spend” rather than “how much you save”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-34"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"For jewelry and gemstones, only test reports bearing the CMA mark are acceptable; you must also verify the issuing agency on the regulator’s official website"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-35"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"Random sales such as blind boxes and gacha games are treated as “money that won’t come back”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-36"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"If you care about what’s in your food, buy pre-packaged products: loose goods at retail counters aren’t legally required to list ingredients"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-37"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"Stocks that have lost value should also be sold according to pre‑set rules — don’t try to even out costs by buying more"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-38"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"Planning to invest in overseas assets such as U.S. stocks? Use QDII funds or the Hong Kong Stock Connect program — don’t open accounts with foreign brokers, and don’t use your annual foreign exchange quota for buying foreign stocks"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-39"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"Only buy insurance for losses your savings can’t cover; use an emergency fund for losses you can afford"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-40"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"If someone at home depends on your income, buy term life insurance for the breadwinner first — not for your kids"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-41"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"Regretting a personal insurance policy signed for over a year? You can cancel it during the cooling-off period and get most of your premium back"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-42"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"Before signing at the bank counter, check whether it’s a deposit or insurance"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-43"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"To cancel your insurance policy, contact the insurer directly — don’t use “policy cancellation agents.” If you feel misled, call 12378 for free assistance"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-44"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"Writing a specific beneficiary on the policy lets family claim the payout: 5 years for life insurance, 2 years for other policies"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-45"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["45"]},"Do not buy cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin or Tether, or join others’ investment schemes: trades lack legal protection, and suing will not recover investment losses"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/05-46"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["46"]},"If you have no employer, pay into China’s employee pension scheme yourself at the lowest contribution tier and first meet the minimum contribution period; even at the lowest tier, it takes about 10 years of pension payments to recover the cost"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/05"},"children":["Chapter 5"," ·"," ","Don’t waste money"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"05-29"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["29"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["When shopping online, follow platform rules and laws — not influencers or “positive reviews”"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["If a seller cheats you, they must pay three times the amount you paid — with a minimum compensation of 500 yuan. Platforms that know sellers are breaking the law but do nothing must share in the liability. The maximum deposit allowed is 20% of the contract value; if you break the contract, that deposit is forfeited, but if the seller does, they must return double the amount. Organizing fake orders or fake positive reviews in livestreams is illegal, and algorithmic price discrimination based on personal data is strictly prohibited."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no cost involved. Just take a moment before orderi…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Sellers found guilty of fraud must pay three times the purchase price, with a minimum payout of 500 yuan. Plat…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: When shopping online, follow platform rules and laws — not influencers or “positive reviews”"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no cost involved. Just take a moment before ordering to read the return policy and deposit rules. After receiving your purchase, keep screenshots of the order, the livestream replay, and any chat records. The real challenge is resisting the persuasive atmosphere created by influencers."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Sellers found guilty of fraud must pay three times the purchase price, with a minimum payout of 500 yuan. Platforms aware — or reasonably expected to know — that sellers are violating laws must also bear joint liability, so you can seek compensation directly from them. Livestream hosts and platforms may not fabricate transaction volumes, follower counts, views, or likes, nor spread false information; doing so incurs civil liability. Those caught orchestrating fake transactions or reviews face fines up to 1 million yuan; repeat offenders may be fined between 1 million and 2 million yuan and even lose their business license. Deposits must stay under 20% of the contract total; if you breach the contract, that deposit is lost, but if the seller does, they must return double it. Using personal data for automated pricing decisions that result in unfair price differences — commonly known as “algorithmic price discrimination” — is illegal nationwide."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2013 修正). 消费者权益保护法（第四十四、五十五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/zfjcj/tzgg/art/2023/art_615af9ed6bcd4974bf853dd2e02bc663.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/zfjcj/tzgg/art/2023/art_615af9ed6bcd4974bf853dd2e02bc663.html"]},"（市场监管总局转载）；国家网信办等七部门 (2021). 网络直播营销管理办法（试行）（第十八、二十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-04/23/content_5601682.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-04/23/content_5601682.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2025 修订). 反不正当竞争法（第九、二十五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ssf.gov.cn/portal/rootfiles/2025/09/01/1758444945285569-1758444945303119.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ssf.gov.cn/portal/rootfiles/2025/09/01/1758444945285569-1758444945303119.pdf"]},"（全国社保基金理事会转载）；全国人大 (2020). 民法典（第五百八十六、五百八十七条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/233181.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/233181.html"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2021). 个人信息保护法（第二十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.stats.gov.cn/gk/tjfg/xgfxfg/202503/t20250310_1958923.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.stats.gov.cn/gk/tjfg/xgfxfg/202503/t20250310_1958923.html"]},"（国家统计局转载）；山东省市场监管局 (2025). 六起网络不正当竞争典型案例. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/jjj/fbzdjz/art/2025/art_cbaed1c006584baeb6823a6b01325ba4.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/jjj/fbzdjz/art/2025/art_cbaed1c006584baeb6823a6b01325ba4.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/zfjcj/tzgg/art/2023/art_615af9ed6bcd4974bf853dd2e02bc663.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["There are no official comparative statistics available on which platforms offer the best value or minimize the risk of buying low-quality goods, so this book does not rank any platforms. The only publicly available data consists of general inspection results (see Section 32 regarding national inspection reports). Following the 2025 revision of China’s Anti-Unfair Competition Law, provisions on false advertising moved from Article 8 to Article 9, while related penalties shifted from Article 20 to Article 25; the new law took effect on October 15, 2025, so be sure to use the updated article numbers. In one case in Shandong, a company organized 75 fake transactions involving over 680,000 yuan; although the exact fine amount was not disclosed, the company was penalized. For information on seven-day unconditional returns, see Section 23 in this chapter (“Making the seven-day return policy work for you”)."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/05-28"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Run a quick comparison before paying off your mortgage — don’t rely on gut feeling"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/05-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"If something goes wrong after buying from a livestream, first ask the platform for the seller’s and influence